# 30. Difference Between append(), extend(), and insert()

| Method             | Purpose                       | Example             | Result        |
| ------------------ | ----------------------------- | ------------------- | ------------- |
| `append(x)`        | Add one item to the end       | `lst.append(4)`     | `[1,2,3,4]`   |
| `extend(iterable)` | Add multiple items            | `lst.extend([4,5])` | `[1,2,3,4,5]` |
| `insert(index, x)` | Insert at a specific position | `lst.insert(1,100)` | `[1,100,2,3]` |

